  "description": "Query Delta Lake tables from .NET with idiomatic LINQ. Translates IQueryable expression trees to SQL pushed down into an embedded DuckDB + delta engine — filtering, projection, ordering, paging, grouping/HAVING, aggregates, inner/left/multi-table joins, async streaming, append writes, and S3/Azure/GCS storage. No Spark, no JVM.",
